    {
      "rect" : [
        [
          -1506.2136598558518,
          -290.20537230901937
        ],
        [
          502.81466906239984,
          863.8323716270297
        ]
      ],
      "note" : "### Background \n\n* Plane\n* PBR Material \/ Shadow Reciever\n* Single diffuse color",
      "id" : "B01D15DF-657B-4297-BF9B-E1D831411DF1"
    },
    {
      "rect" : [
        [
          -807.559046608405,
          -270.0373186462566
        ],
        [
          2348.005881083769,
          1486.577410082431
        ]
      ],
      "note" : "# Genuary 2\n\n## Twelve principles of animation.\n\nThis is a ‘remix’ of Genuary 1\n\nWe add easing functins via the `Number Easing` nodes, ie \n\n![Easing Functions](https:\/\/radialglo.github.io\/images\/easings.png)\n\n\n* We use a Number Integrator adjust our time\n* We mod 1 it to ensure all values are 0 - 1\n* We then scale and clamp it, weird, but it lets us ‘pause’ the animation at the head and the tail\n* We then run 2 easing functions. \n* We also use our main Number Integrator to adjust our texture on our sphere. \n\n### Experiment:\nPlay with the easing functions to change the character of the animation!\n\n",
      "id" : "22D25960-13D3-403B-9D13-CAE16EB605F1"
    }
  ],
  "id" : "AFCB2C8C-88C4-4163-84FD-22D9726543B5"
}